{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先ほどレコメンが終わりましたー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ先輩と2人でゲスト出演\nさせて頂いたのですが、\nスタッフさん、そしてのりさんに\n優しく迎え入れて下さり\nすごく楽しい時間を過ごせました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりラジオってたのしい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりのラジオでしたが\nやっぱりラジオ好きだなーと思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！スイカは食べ過ぎても\n私はお腹を壊さないタイプなので\nご心配なく♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日のスイカもたのしみ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ先輩の帰ってからどのくらいの速さでお風呂にいけるのか\n私も今日挑戦してみようかな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、でも帰ってきたら\nまずチップにあいさつしないといけないから\n絶対遅いタイムだろうな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しょうがない！チップを怒らせちゃうと\nなかなか相手にしてくれなくなっちゃうから\nチップ優先にしなきゃ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、お風呂早く入るタイム競争は\n遠征先のホテルとかでやろうかな！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！あとみさ先輩のお家に泊まりに行った時とか٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はやくみさ先輩のお家に\nお泊まりいきたいな～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんお話しするんだ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/31/2201622/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/31/2201622/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなお姉ちゃん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ姉！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/31/2201622/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のりさん、スタッフさん、みさ先輩\n今日はありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても楽しかったです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、レコメンに呼んでもらえたら\nいいな～٩(ˊᗜˋ*)و♪えへへーーー！"}],"source":"archive"}